sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Client App
    participant API as Server
    participant DB as Database

    U->>UI: Enter URL, client_id, password

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
    Note over UI,API: REGISTRATION (one-time)
    UI->>API: GET /parameters
    API-->>UI: 200 { P, G }
    Note over UI,API: P is a 2048-bit safe prime, Q = (P-1)/2, G = 4
    Note over UI: x = derive(password, salt) mod Q <br/><br/> y = G^x mod P  (x is never transmitted or stored) <br/><br/> Persist salt in secure local storage, discard x from memory
    UI->>API: POST /register  { client_id, y }
    break missing client_id or secret_y field
        API-->>UI: 400 { reason: missing parameters }
        UI-->>U: Error - missing parameters
    end
    break y not in Schnorr subgroup  (1 < y < P  AND  y^Q == 1 mod P)
        API-->>UI: 422 { reason: invalid public value }
        UI-->>U: Error - invalid public value <br/>(blocks small-subgroup attacks)
    end
    alt New client_id
        API->>DB: INSERT user(client_id, secret_y=y)
        DB-->>API: OK
        API-->>UI: 201 { status: Registered }
        UI-->>U: Registered successfully
    else client_id already exists
        API-->>UI: 409 { reason: already registered }
        UI-->>U: Error - already registered
    end
    end

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
    Note over UI,API: COMMIT PHASE
    UI->>API: GET /parameters
    API-->>UI: 200 { P, G }
    Note over UI:  x = derive(password, stored_salt) mod Q <br/><br/> r = random in [1, Q-1] <br/><br/> Commitment T = G^r mod P <br/><br/> Verify T is a valid subgroup element before sending 
    UI->>API: POST /login/commit  { client_id, T }
    break missing client_id or commitment_t field
        API-->>UI: 400 { reason: missing parameters }
    end
    break T not in subgroup
        Note over API: Small-subgroup / invalid-curve attack prevention
        API-->>UI: 422 { reason: invalid commitment }
    end
    break user not found
        API-->>UI: 404 { reason: user not registered }
    end
   
    Note over API: Generate random session_id <br/><br/> binding = H( TCP_peer_addr || User-Agent || session_id || client_id || T )<br/><br/> Generate challenge c = int(binding) mod (P-2) + 1  <br/><br/> Store { T, c, binding, peer_addr, timestamp } 
    API-->>UI: 200 { session_id, challenge_c }
    end

    Note over UI: s = (r + c * x) mod Q<br/><br/>Wipe r and x from memory after computing s

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
    Note over UI,API: VERIFY PHASE
    UI->>API: POST /login/verify  { solution_s }<br/><br/> X-Auth-Session: session_id 
    break session_id not found
        API-->>UI: 404 { reason: invalid session_id }
    end
    break session expired  (TTL = 5 s from commit)
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 401 { reason: session expired }
    end
    break s out of range [0, Q)
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 422 { reason: invalid solution }
        Note  over API: Range check - rejects trivially invalid proofs
    end
    Note over API: Compute binding (peer_addr, UA, session_id, client_id, T)
    break binding mismatch
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 401 { reason: session binding mismatch }
        Note over API: Relay / MITM detected <br/>IP or UA changed between commit and verify
    end
    break challenge integrity check failed
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 400 { reason: challenge integrity check failed }
        Note over API: Session field tampered
    end
    API->>DB: SELECT secret_y WHERE client_id=?
    DB-->>API: { secret_y=y }
    Note over API: Check  G^s == T * y^c  (mod P)
    alt proof valid
        API->>DB: INSERT AuthToken(JWT, client_id, issued_at)
        DB-->>API: OK
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 200 { JWT } 
        Note over UI: Store JWT in HttpOnly cookie or platform secure storage
        UI-->>U: Authenticated - JWT stored
    else proof invalid
        API->>API: DELETE sessions[session_id]
        API-->>UI: 401 { reason: verification failed }
        UI-->>U: Error - unauthorized
    end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over UI,API: AUTHENTICATED ACCESS
    UI->>API: GET /data  Authorization: Bearer { JWT }
    API->>API: Decode and validate JWT signature (HS256) and expiry
    alt valid token
        API->>DB: SELECT personal_data WHERE client_id=?
        DB-->>API: { data }
        API-->>UI: 200 { data }
        UI-->>U: Display result
    else invalid or expired token
        API-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
        UI-->>U: Error - unauthorized
    end
    end

    Note over API: Every response carries security and tracing headers